pyCamSet NOTICE
===============

This file lists the licences that apply to pyCamSet and, separately, to the
third-party code this repository references as the git submodule
third_party/aruco2. The entries are kept apart because they are not all the
same licence.

third_party/aruco2 is not part of pyCamSet's source distribution or wheel:
pyproject.toml excludes third_party from package discovery. Its files are
present only in a checkout made with `git clone --recurse-submodules`, or after
`git submodule update --init`.


